    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "x² - 4 = (x+2)(x-2)，所以(x²-4)/(x+2) = (x+2)(x-2)/(x+2) = x - 2（x ≠ -2）。",
    "hint": "分子用平方差公式分解",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
